usage:
./bk-partite <k-partite graph file> <flags>  

The only flags that are guaranteed to work are the -p, -inter, and -intra flags. 
Use the -p flag to print out all maximal k-cliques.
Using the -inter flag is recommded; it usually results in significant speedup.
Using the -intra flag is NOT recommended; it usually results in a significant     
slowdown. It's only there for testing purposes.

